{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49117","headline":"破陈子 · 後主煜","name":"破陈子","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"四十年来家国，三千里地山河。\n凤阙龙楼连霄汉，玉树琼枝作烟萝，几曾识干戈？\n一旦归爲臣虏，沈腰潘鬓销磨。\n最是苍黄辞庙日，教坊独奏别离歌，垂泪对宫娥。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"後主煜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49117.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49117","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}